# Authentication & Security Rules

## 🔐 Security Patterns

### JWT Token Management

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Token management with axios interceptors
const axiosInstance = axios.create({
  baseURL: BASE_URL,
  withCredentials: true,
});

// Request interceptor
axiosInstance.interceptors.request.use(async (config) => {
  if (!config.headers) {
    return config;
  }
  return config;
});

// Response interceptor with token refresh
axiosInstance.interceptors.response.use(
  (res) => res,
  async (error) => {
    const axiosError = getAxiosError(error);

    if (axiosError?.data.code === ERROR_CODE.ACCESS_EXPIRED) {
      return resetTokenAndReattemptRequest(axiosError);
    }

    if (axiosError?.data.code === ERROR_CODE.REFRESH_EXPIRED) {
      removeRefreshAndSignOut();
      return Promise.reject(axiosError);
    }

    return Promise.reject(error);
  }
);
```

### MUST FOLLOW Rules

✅ **ALWAYS** use JWT tokens for authentication
✅ **ALWAYS** implement automatic token refresh
✅ **ALWAYS** store sensitive data in httpOnly cookies
✅ **ALWAYS** validate user permissions on both client and server
✅ **ALWAYS** implement proper logout functionality
✅ **ALWAYS** handle authentication errors gracefully
✅ **ALWAYS** use HTTPS for all API communications

### NEVER DO Rules

❌ **NEVER** store tokens in localStorage
❌ **NEVER** send sensitive data in URL parameters
❌ **NEVER** trust client-side validation only
❌ **NEVER** forget to handle token expiration
❌ **NEVER** expose sensitive information in error messages
❌ **NEVER** use weak authentication methods

### Authorization Pattern

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Authorization utility
class Authorization {
  static isMoreThanExecutive(grade: Grade) {
    return grade === "PRESIDENT" || grade === "EXECUTIVE";
  }

  static isPresident(grade: Grade) {
    return grade === "PRESIDENT";
  }
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Protected component
function ProtectedComponent({ requiredRole }: { requiredRole: string }) {
  const { user, isAdmin, isPresident } = useAuth();

  if (!user) return <LoginRequired />;
  if (requiredRole === "admin" && !isAdmin) return <AccessDenied />;
  if (requiredRole === "president" && !isPresident) return <AccessDenied />;

  return <ProtectedContent />;
}
```

### Cookie Management

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Secure cookie management
export const setCookie = (
  name: string,
  value: string,
  options?: CookieSetOptions
) => {
  return cookies.set(name, value, {
    ...options,
    secure: true,
    sameSite: "strict",
    httpOnly: true,
  });
};

export const getCookie = (name: string) => {
  return cookies.get(name);
};

export const removeCookie = (name: string) => {
  return cookies.remove(name);
};
```

